    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The All-Knowing, Ever-Present God"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director. A psalm of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, you have searched me and known me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You know when I sit down and when I stand up;",
          "you understand my thoughts from far away."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You observe my travels and my rest;",
          "you are aware of all my ways."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Before a word is on my tongue,",
          "you know all about it, Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You have encircled me;",
          "you have placed your hand on me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "This wondrous knowledge is beyond me.",
          "It is lofty; I am unable to reach it."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Where can I go to escape your Spirit?",
          "Where can I flee from your presence?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If I go up to heaven, you are there;",
          "if I make my bed in Sheol, you are there."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If I fly on the wings of the dawn",
          "and settle down on the western horizon,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "even there your hand will lead me;",
          "your right hand will hold on to me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If I say, “Surely the darkness will hide me,",
          "and the light around me will be night” —"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "even the darkness is not dark to you.",
          "The night shines like the day;",
          "darkness and light are alike to you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For it was you who created my inward parts;",
          "you knit me together in my mother’s womb."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will praise you",
          "because I have been remarkably and wondrously made. ,",
          "Your works are wondrous,",
          "and I know this very well."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My bones were not hidden from you",
          "when I was made in secret,",
          "when I was formed in the depths of the earth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Your eyes saw me when I was formless;",
          "all my days were written in your book and planned",
          "before a single one of them began."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God, how precious your thoughts are to me;",
          "how vast their sum is!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If I counted them,",
          "they would outnumber the grains of sand;",
          "when I wake up, I am still with you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God, if only you would kill the wicked —",
          "you bloodthirsty men, stay away from me —"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "who invoke you deceitfully.",
          "Your enemies swear by you falsely."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, don’t I hate those who hate you,",
          "and detest those who rebel against you?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I hate them with extreme hatred;",
          "I consider them my enemies."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Search me, God, and know my heart;",
          "test me and know my concerns."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "See if there is any offensive way in me;",
          "lead me in the everlasting way."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
